                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "While the game is fun, there is simply not enough of it. Only took me 49 minutes, and 10 of that was spent looking for an Item that was hidden in the shadow of another innocuous item.\n\nThe good:\nGreat graphics for VR.\nPlenty of interactive items.\nNice sound design with an interesting way to do ambient music.\n\nThe bad:\nFar too short for the price with a cliffhanger ending that doesn't explain anything and a promise of future \"Episodes\".\n\nOverall, I would say wait for it to go on sale at about 6-7 dollars. Or the price just drops",
